    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/533b6a019df2793d127f23f5425e9b4b.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/533b6a019df2793d127f23f5425e9b4b.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/533b6a019df2793d127f23f5425e9b4b.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/3ef0bda7e09d19514725b9d96c5141ca.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/3ef0bda7e09d19514725b9d96c5141ca.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/3ef0bda7e09d19514725b9d96c5141ca.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the horror classics of the 90s and 2000s,\u00a0SANGRA brings back the oppressive atmosphere and mechanics that defined the genre.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With modern controls and an over-the-shoulder third-person camera, the classic experience gets a contemporary touch without losing the essence of <strong>true survival horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/d61f3a1f83de17dd11bb17bd08587dcf.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/d61f3a1f83de17dd11bb17bd08587dcf.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/d61f3a1f83de17dd11bb17bd08587dcf.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES &amp; UNLOCK DOORS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keys, codes, and logic to solve puzzles that respect the player's intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse wisely through a maze of doors and claustrophic corridors, through a tightly crafted interconnected map (in a &quot;metroidvania&quot; style).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE SCARCE RESOURCES &amp; MAKE TOUGH DECISIONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a tight inventory and limited resources, every moment in the game is a difficult choice. Will you fight or flee?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress and store items in safe rooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/f77d2389dd14b75b0c40f588242cfd91.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/f77d2389dd14b75b0c40f588242cfd91.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/f77d2389dd14b75b0c40f588242cfd91.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/fb2f7410520a3a2024e5f0c873f89154.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/fb2f7410520a3a2024e5f0c873f89154.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/fb2f7410520a3a2024e5f0c873f89154.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A research facility plunged into chaos. In a dystopian world, a mysterious metallic substance spreads, consuming both flesh and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a groundbreaking extraction experiment now demands its price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/81788027c678378c635351570e39847d.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/81788027c678378c635351570e39847d.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/81788027c678378c635351570e39847d.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER A MYSTERY REVEALED IN FRAGMENTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out the narrative on your own through documents and clever environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE METALLIC CORRUPTION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls that bleed steel, unexplainable creatures\u2026 and something worse lurking below.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/533b6a019df2793d127f23f5425e9b4b.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/533b6a019df2793d127f23f5425e9b4b.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/533b6a019df2793d127f23f5425e9b4b.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/3ef0bda7e09d19514725b9d96c5141ca.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/3ef0bda7e09d19514725b9d96c5141ca.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/3ef0bda7e09d19514725b9d96c5141ca.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Inspired by the horror classics of the 90s and 2000s,\u00a0SANGRA brings back the oppressive atmosphere and mechanics that defined the genre.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With modern controls and an over-the-shoulder third-person camera, the classic experience gets a contemporary touch without losing the essence of <strong>true survival horror</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/d61f3a1f83de17dd11bb17bd08587dcf.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/d61f3a1f83de17dd11bb17bd08587dcf.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/d61f3a1f83de17dd11bb17bd08587dcf.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SOLVE PUZZLES &amp; UNLOCK DOORS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use keys, codes, and logic to solve puzzles that respect the player's intelligence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse wisely through a maze of doors and claustrophic corridors, through a tightly crafted interconnected map (in a &quot;metroidvania&quot; style).</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MANAGE SCARCE RESOURCES &amp; MAKE TOUGH DECISIONS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a tight inventory and limited resources, every moment in the game is a difficult choice. Will you fight or flee?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save your progress and store items in safe rooms.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/f77d2389dd14b75b0c40f588242cfd91.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=74 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/f77d2389dd14b75b0c40f588242cfd91.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/f77d2389dd14b75b0c40f588242cfd91.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/fb2f7410520a3a2024e5f0c873f89154.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/fb2f7410520a3a2024e5f0c873f89154.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/fb2f7410520a3a2024e5f0c873f89154.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A research facility plunged into chaos. In a dystopian world, a mysterious metallic substance spreads, consuming both flesh and sanity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What was meant to be a groundbreaking extraction experiment now demands its price.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/81788027c678378c635351570e39847d.poster.avif?t=1755633554\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/81788027c678378c635351570e39847d.webm?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510530/extras/81788027c678378c635351570e39847d.mp4?t=1755633554\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>UNCOVER A MYSTERY REVEALED IN FRAGMENTS</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Figure out the narrative on your own through documents and clever environmental storytelling.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ESCAPE THE METALLIC CORRUPTION</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Walls that bleed steel, unexplainable creatures\u2026 and something worse lurking below.</p></li></ul>",
